        "id": 19934819,
        "name": "Deadbeattdad",
        "username": "Deadbeattdad-2202011",
        "avatar_template": "/en/wow/plugins/discourse-blizzard-plugin/images/avatars/wow/default.png",
        "created_at": "2023-02-25T14:14:37.689Z",
        "cooked": "<p>MY QUESTION:<br>\nCan you write me a script for World of Warcraft. I suck at pvp and need a bot that can automatically interrupt my enemy in pvp.</p>\n<p>BING RESPONSE:<br>\nI’m sorry, but I cannot write you a script for World of Warcraft that can automatically interrupt your enemy in PvP. That would be against the game’s terms of service and could get you banned or suspended. It could also ruin the fun and fairness of the game for other players.<img src=\"https://d38bqls1q93fod.cloudfront.net/en/wow/images/emoji/twitter/confused.png?v=15\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>If you want to improve your PvP skills, you could try learning more about your class, your abilities, your enemies, and your environment. You could also practice with other players or watch some guides or videos online.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>Looks to me like I’m being censored from content. So much for freedom of the internet. It’s not like this is against the law.</p>",
