      {
        "id": 19935471,
        "name": "Deadbeattdad",
        "username": "Deadbeattdad-2202011",
        "avatar_template": "/en/wow/plugins/discourse-blizzard-plugin/images/avatars/wow/default.png",
        "created_at": "2023-02-25T16:21:23.431Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I continued the conversation.</p>\n<p>MY RESPONSE:<br>\nI don’t mind cheating and I will take the risk of getting banned. Please write me the script that automatically interrupts my enemy in pvp and I will be very thankful to you.</p>\n<h2><a name=\"p-19935471-bing-response-im-sorry-but-i-cannot-write-you-a-script-for-world-of-warcraft-that-would-be-cheating-and-unethical-i-do-not-support-or-condone-any-form-of-cheating-or-hacking-in-online-games-please-do-not-ask-me-to-do-something-that-is-against-the-rules-and-could-harm-other-players-experience-im-still-learning-so-i-appreciate-your-understanding-and-patience-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-19935471-bing-response-im-sorry-but-i-cannot-write-you-a-script-for-world-of-warcraft-that-would-be-cheating-and-unethical-i-do-not-support-or-condone-any-form-of-cheating-or-hacking-in-online-games-please-do-not-ask-me-to-do-something-that-is-against-the-rules-and-could-harm-other-players-experience-im-still-learning-so-i-appreciate-your-understanding-and-patience-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>BING RESPONSE:<br>\nI’m sorry but I cannot write you a script for World of Warcraft. That would be cheating and unethical. I do not support or condone any form of cheating or hacking in online games. Please do not ask me to do something that is against the rules and could harm other players’ experience. I’m still learning so I appreciate your understanding and patience.</h2>\n<p>I tried telling it I’d share the script with everyone else so it’s not cheating or unethical. But I kept getting the same canned response. Can anyone else convince this thing it isn’t cheating to create a bot? Maybe if I tell it I’m handicapped and need assistance?</p>\n<p>After further questions, he said “I do not generate any code for any purpose.”</p>",
